@title EPISODE 12 • FAMILY WEEKEND
@bg penthouse_day
Family Weekend. Frank and Vega Sterling arrive with flowers, a chef, and a list of questions.
Vega: My girls! Let me look at you. London, is that a bruise? Paris, why are your eyes puffy?
Later, while Frank argues with the chef, Vega pulls London aside by the window. Her voice drops.
Vega: Baby. Are you doing okay? Really okay? You're keeping your appointments?
London: Mama. Every week. I promise. Dr. Ames says I'm doing good.
Vega: (holding her face) I know you are. I just had to hear you say it.
London lets her mother hold on a little longer than usual. She's been in recovery since she was fourteen. Her parents have been holding their breath since then too.
Frank: And who is "D" and why is he in the family Find My Friends screenshot Cassie's cousin sent your mother?
> [Bold] "He's my study partner. And a friend." -> f1
> [Bitchy] "Since when do we let Cassie's COUSIN run this family?" -> f2
> [Sweet] "Daddy, you'd actually like him." -> f3
> [Bad] "No idea. Probably spam." -> f4
